"P3222944058" "Rikti_Defender"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Radiation Emission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3883900150" "Radiation Emission"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1434954307" "Team AoE Ally +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1581759498" "The Radiation Emission power utilizes the healing properties of radiation to re-energize your allies. This power radiates out from the Rikti and restores some health to all nearby allies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Accelerate Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P275167913" "Accelerate Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2922328490" "Team AoE +Speed, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam +Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1785856035" "Activating this power emits radiation that increases the running speed, attack speed, Endurance Recovery and Damage potential of all nearby allies.  Affected Rikti Metabolism is increased so much that they become resistant to effects such as Sleep, Hold, Disorient and Immobilization.  The Rikti are not protected from such effects, they just ware off faster."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Protection Shield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P816401165" "Protection Shield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1594771831" "Ally +DEF(Smash, Lethal, Fire, Cold, Energy, Negative)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1406840502" "The Protection Shield protects others from smashing, lethal, fire, cold, energy and negative energy attacks for a limited time. The magnetic nature of the shield makes attacks less likely to land and affect your ally.  Multiple Shields can be stacked on one target to improve the defense."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3976820757" "{PlayerSource} protects you from physical attacks with a {PowerName}."

