"P1723798362" "PBAoE, Ally +Regeneration"
// Power Help Text :
"P4242341930" "The Regeneration Aura dramatically increases the healing rate of all nearby heroes for a limited time. Emitting this Aura costs you a lot of Endurance, and it takes a long time to recharge. Recharge: Very Long"
